:p0738:b003:l039","ordinal":350695,"en":"Shame on the hairy chest,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0738:b003:l040","ordinal":350696,"en":"I will not hurt others -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l001","ordinal":350697,"en":"We are angry together."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l002","ordinal":350698,"en":"A spoonful of blood remains,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l003","ordinal":350699,"en":"Big crush on Semetey."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l004","ordinal":350700,"en":"Screamed from the top of the mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l005","ordinal":350701,"en":"I have become them."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l006","ordinal":350702,"en":"Let's take a look,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l007","ordinal":350703,"en":"I came as a fan."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l008","ordinal":350704,"en":"I was walking alive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l009","ordinal":350705,"en":"I burned like fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l010","ordinal":350706,"en":"I opened it too late,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l011","ordinal":350707,"en":"To touch Er Sultan"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l012","ordinal":350708,"en":"I had four eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l013","ordinal":350709,"en":"In the form of my absent father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l014","ordinal":350710,"en":"How many years have I been there?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l015","ordinal":350711,"en":"I will go to a murderous party -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l016","ordinal":350712,"en":"Kadir Alda alone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l017","ordinal":350713,"en":"I was asking for this."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l018","ordinal":350714,"en":"I'm broken,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l019","ordinal":350715,"en":"Collect what I scattered!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l020","ordinal":350716,"en":"Serve without freezing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l021","ordinal":350717,"en":"Answer without delay."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l022","ordinal":350718,"en":"Do not close my eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l023","ordinal":350719,"en":"Don't upset me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0739:b002:l024","ordinal":350720,"en":"Listen to me,"}]
